  "title": "Quaint Indulgent Saudi Arabian Shrimp Pilaf",
  "description": "A floral and snappy Saudi Arabian dish featuring seasoned rice vinegar, this pescatarian-friendly pilaf is cooked to perfection in a Dutch oven. It is an indulgent and flavorful meal option.",
